# Ctrl+\ on the Starred entry opens its context menu, whose Open in New Pane shows the Starred view in a new pane.
size 100 30
file <<END
Ideas:
	- Podcast @star
END
keys <C-g>
type starred
keys <C-\>
see Go to Entry
see Return to Outline
type open
keys <Enter>
see │  󰓎 Starred
see │▌ - Podcast 󰓎  Ideas
hide Navigator
quit
